      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Agree, as I understood, right now owner of the group can hide/show members, but member itself can't rly control who and how can see their membership. This is bad practice that WILL cause major misunderstanding, confusion and conflicts at some point. People should be able to control own privacy as primary feature, and group owner preferencies should be secondary feature.\n\nIt would be better if players can choose, who can see membership (no one, friends, friends+, anyone) and owner can optionally restrict visibility to more privvate one. It's also should be consistent: if membership can't be seen on group page, it's should not be seen in user profile.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
